WEBVTT

00:07.820 --> 00:10.850
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:11.490 --> 00:14.360
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:14.990 --> 00:18.020
The passion, the way it was born

00:18.500 --> 00:21.430
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:22.140 --> 00:25.260
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:25.670 --> 00:28.870
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:29.440 --> 00:32.570
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:32.880 --> 00:35.510
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:36.520 --> 00:38.450
Don't be afraid

00:38.450 --> 00:40.320
Going from one push after another

00:40.320 --> 00:42.120
The surprising feeling is nice

00:42.120 --> 00:43.790
And you end up dancing till morning

00:43.790 --> 00:45.560
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.560 --> 00:49.050
TROPICANA

00:50.930 --> 00:54.200
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:54.630 --> 00:57.660
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:58.300 --> 01:01.400
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:02.040 --> 01:05.100
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:05.610 --> 01:08.550
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:09.180 --> 01:12.120
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:12.750 --> 01:15.740
The passion, the way it was born

01:16.320 --> 01:18.380
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:35.310 --> 01:38.280
Robert-San

01:39.520 --> 01:41.210
Now, is this all of the luggage?

01:41.290 --> 01:41.880
That's it.

01:42.850 --> 01:46.120
Then, we'll take the luggage
and head home first.

01:46.320 --> 01:49.990
Someone will come to pick you up,
so please wait here.

01:50.430 --> 01:54.460
You want us... to wait here...
in these outfits!?

01:54.930 --> 01:55.420
So cold...

01:56.370 --> 01:59.130
Well, Ojou-sama, those were the only winter
clothes you had.

01:59.400 --> 02:02.410
But you guys are all prepared with your
coats and stuff!

02:02.410 --> 02:03.200
That pisses me off!

02:09.910 --> 02:12.910
You should've spoken up sooner, if that was
what you wanted.

02:12.980 --> 02:14.610
Come here! I'll keep you warm.

02:15.120 --> 02:17.640
Hey, hey!
That's no way to warm someone up...

02:17.960 --> 02:21.060
Oh, Ashio, you're so kind...

02:21.060 --> 02:22.530
You're so warm.

02:22.730 --> 02:25.530
And someone who goes
along with it... No way!

02:26.230 --> 02:27.090
Ow...

02:27.970 --> 02:30.870
Ojou-sama, please wear my coat!

02:30.940 --> 02:32.160
All right!

02:33.140 --> 02:36.330
Oh, this is so warm!

02:36.670 --> 02:38.610
U-Um...

02:39.140 --> 02:40.010
Hare-sama...

02:40.610 --> 02:44.550
In the city, they say that
"All children are children of the wind."

02:46.150 --> 02:47.810
No, wait, hold on...

02:59.130 --> 03:01.690
Why... do we need someone to pick us up?

03:01.830 --> 03:03.420
Oh, I don't know why.

03:03.930 --> 03:05.420
This is so warm!

03:05.700 --> 03:10.660
Geez, what should I think of this mother that
chooses her own warmth over her child...

03:15.350 --> 03:19.410
And she looks warm no matter
how you look at her.

03:20.920 --> 03:22.680
Guu wouldn't possibly...

03:22.890 --> 03:24.720
What, you're cold?

03:25.890 --> 03:27.320
Here, wear this.

03:27.490 --> 03:29.460
Guu, thanks!

03:29.590 --> 03:30.990
No problem.

03:32.460 --> 03:35.090
Something like that would never happen...

03:36.200 --> 03:38.170
Whats wrong? Are you cold?

03:39.170 --> 03:40.570
You want me to lend you mine?

03:41.240 --> 03:44.210
I-It's all right, you must be cold too, Guu.

03:45.140 --> 03:46.340
Don't be so modest.

03:48.250 --> 03:49.410
Thanks...

03:51.550 --> 03:54.280
I wonder who's going to pick us up?

03:55.320 --> 03:57.510
I sure hope it's someone normal.

03:57.920 --> 04:00.550
...because it's usually me that
has a hellish time with them.

04:00.720 --> 04:01.660
You do?

04:01.730 --> 04:04.850
I think someone slightly strange would be
amusing, and so, more fun.

04:05.800 --> 04:06.960
Like what kinda guy?

04:07.060 --> 04:09.430
For instance... like Guu-chan!

04:10.470 --> 04:11.670
Someone like Guu?

04:11.670 --> 04:14.760
No! No way! Absolutely not!

04:15.470 --> 04:18.870
Now that's being rude to Guu-chan!
Apologize!

04:19.340 --> 04:20.810
I-I'm sorry...

04:21.110 --> 04:22.700
Oh, its all right.

04:22.880 --> 04:25.510
Oh, Guu-chan, you're so forgiving...

04:25.780 --> 04:28.780
Oh, why do things always turn out this way?

04:36.060 --> 04:38.290
Hey, Mom, that guy's looking over here.

04:38.500 --> 04:40.490
Maybe he's the guy who's here to pick us up.

04:41.830 --> 04:45.270
The way he's looking at me...

04:45.500 --> 04:47.130
Maybe he's a scout for a model agency!

04:49.370 --> 04:50.360
Oh, here he comes!

04:50.640 --> 04:51.440
Just as I thought!

04:54.450 --> 04:56.000
Can I help you?

04:57.480 --> 04:59.810
Please, don't speak too loudly.

05:00.020 --> 05:00.640
Yes?

05:01.190 --> 05:03.280
I'm here on Bell-san's orders.

05:03.820 --> 05:04.620
You must be Weda-sama?

05:04.620 --> 05:06.210
Yes, I am...

05:08.560 --> 05:09.890
I was sent here to pick you up.

05:09.990 --> 05:11.930
I'm Robert. Nice to meet you.

05:12.200 --> 05:14.320
So you were the guy who
came here to pick us up!

05:14.530 --> 05:16.860
But why are you whispering?

05:17.400 --> 05:20.170
Because someone might be after her.

05:21.240 --> 05:23.840
In the city, you're always
surrounded by danger.

05:23.840 --> 05:25.930
It wouldn't be unusual
for anything to happen.

05:26.080 --> 05:31.040
That is why I, a professional guard,
am here to pick her up.

05:32.920 --> 05:35.320
A suspicious man is looking this way...

05:44.160 --> 05:46.930
No, I think he's just
looking at the arrival board.

05:47.800 --> 05:49.930
Now, hurry. It's dangerous to stay here!

05:50.330 --> 05:53.460
It can't be... This guy is another weirdo?

05:53.600 --> 05:57.600
Oh, brother... strange guys are
attracted to us, even in the city...

05:57.680 --> 05:59.200
It's such a nuisance.

05:59.480 --> 06:02.210
W-What? You're saying I'm the reason!?

06:04.780 --> 06:05.580
Look out!

06:05.880 --> 06:07.110
Get down, Hare-sama!

06:21.400 --> 06:24.030
Whew, it was just a mistake. We're fine.

06:24.030 --> 06:25.070
It's not fine!

06:25.070 --> 06:26.870
Just a misunderstanding.

06:26.870 --> 06:28.570
I thought it was a gunshot!

06:28.570 --> 06:29.900
Oh, it's just a burst tire.

06:30.370 --> 06:33.170
And the first misunderstanding is creating a
different misunderstanding...

06:34.550 --> 06:36.380
Misunderstanding... a misunderstanding...

06:36.580 --> 06:43.210
Oh, Bell-san told me to bring you to the
mansion safe and sound, so it seems that I'm
being a little over sensitive.

06:43.890 --> 06:47.190
No, actually, you're being very over sensitive.

06:47.460 --> 06:51.420
Now, we should hurry to the car before
someone else comes after us!

06:52.000 --> 06:54.230
You know, nobody was after us...

06:54.570 --> 06:57.360
Weda-sama, make sure to stay behind me.

06:57.800 --> 07:00.500
You know, this guy seems a little strange.

07:00.840 --> 07:03.360
No, he's really strange! A complete weirdo!

07:03.740 --> 07:07.800
It's rude to treat someone
you just met as a weird guy.

07:08.110 --> 07:10.480
Oh, you're right. I'm sorry.

07:10.480 --> 07:13.010
Guu-chan, you said something good there.
I've learned my lesson.

07:13.380 --> 07:15.220
Well, I guess that's true...

07:15.350 --> 07:18.290
It's just me overreacting, I'm sure.

07:27.900 --> 07:29.960
Wow, amazing!

07:30.130 --> 07:33.540
A lot of things change when
more than ten years pass.

07:34.140 --> 07:35.900
Buildings everywhere!

07:36.010 --> 07:37.470
It's a concrete jungle.

07:37.680 --> 07:38.940
A jungle, huh?

07:39.510 --> 07:42.000
Mom, I want to look around for a bit.

07:42.280 --> 07:49.340
Haré-sama, the concrete jungle
has many dangerous places, unlike the
jungle that you grew up in.

07:49.620 --> 07:50.850
Oh, I see...

07:50.850 --> 07:53.380
Then I guess it's better not go outside?

07:53.690 --> 07:54.620
No, no...

07:55.460 --> 07:59.560
If you're going to
tour the city, I will guide you.

07:59.830 --> 08:02.630
Furthermore, I will protect you from all harm.

08:02.770 --> 08:03.820
Please rest assured.

08:04.940 --> 08:07.340
He's a nice guy after all.

08:07.600 --> 08:10.470
Although he overreacts
to his surroundings and goes ballistic.

08:10.570 --> 08:13.740
But then, that might be because his desire to
protect someone is so powerful.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.150
Hey, Guu.

08:15.150 --> 08:19.740
As long as Robert doesn't think we're being
threatened, he's a normal guy, isn't he?

08:21.390 --> 08:22.410
Hey, Haré?

08:22.650 --> 08:24.850
Isn't that car behind us a little strange?

08:26.120 --> 08:29.890
I just can't shake the feeling
that we're being followed...

08:29.990 --> 08:31.190
Hey now...

08:31.400 --> 08:33.450
Maybe someone is after us?

08:33.900 --> 08:36.160
W-Why do you try to stir up trouble?

08:36.530 --> 08:38.400
Mom, say something!

08:52.420 --> 08:56.510
In the first place, such an ordinary couple
wouldn't be coming after us!

08:56.590 --> 08:58.720
Can't you come up with a better lie than that?

08:58.720 --> 08:59.480
No!

09:03.890 --> 09:06.920
That may all be a facade...

09:07.500 --> 09:09.690
W-Wait a minute...

09:10.100 --> 09:13.760
That might all be an act to trick us.

09:17.210 --> 09:19.440
The probability that someone
is after us is high, after all!

09:20.640 --> 09:22.540
Wha... Look out!

09:27.790 --> 09:29.220
Just as I thought! They came to ram us!

09:29.320 --> 09:31.450
No, no! We backed into them!

09:31.520 --> 09:33.460
Maybe they have comrades?

09:33.720 --> 09:35.420
There's a possibility of being surrounded!

09:35.730 --> 09:37.790
We must get away from this
area immediately!

09:49.810 --> 09:50.900
Did we shake 'em off?

09:51.140 --> 09:53.270
There's a red car coming after us.

09:54.780 --> 09:57.040
Damn! So there were more of them!

10:02.150 --> 10:04.450
Wait, that's a fire truck!

10:06.220 --> 10:07.490
They're persistent!

10:07.490 --> 10:09.580
Hey! Listen to what I'm saying!

10:15.000 --> 10:16.730
Stop it!

10:27.680 --> 10:29.080
More of them!?

10:29.150 --> 10:30.700
That's an ambulance!

10:34.520 --> 10:35.850
Excellent! We shook them off!

10:35.950 --> 10:37.150
You've got it wrong!

10:37.150 --> 10:39.120
Slow down!!

10:45.630 --> 10:46.890
This is the worst!

10:53.770 --> 10:55.600
This is a nightmare...

10:55.870 --> 10:58.870
Help me!

11:01.350 --> 11:03.340
Haré!

11:08.890 --> 11:11.320
Haré-sama, Haré-sama!

11:13.760 --> 11:15.520
You've finally woken up.

11:15.960 --> 11:17.930
Bell! Good morning...

11:18.800 --> 11:19.920
This place?

11:20.000 --> 11:21.560
This is your room, Haré-sama.

11:21.670 --> 11:23.690
I showed you here last night, didn't I?

11:24.840 --> 11:25.670
Last night?

11:27.000 --> 11:28.970
Come to think of it, the moment you arrived
at the mansion, you said...

11:29.410 --> 11:30.900
I-I'm tired...

11:31.010 --> 11:33.640
...and with that one sentence,
you fell right asleep.

11:34.180 --> 11:37.270
I heard you went visiting all sorts of places
with Robert yesterday...

11:37.550 --> 11:39.610
I'm sure you got tired
from having too much fun.

11:40.820 --> 11:41.590
No...

11:41.590 --> 11:44.450
I heard that you visited
the police station as well...

11:44.620 --> 11:45.880
Wasn't that fun?

11:46.420 --> 11:50.190
Actually, it wasn't just a visit. They were
interrogating us!

11:50.260 --> 11:51.960
The truth is getting all twisted around here!

11:52.200 --> 11:54.790
Ojou-sama and Guu-sama are eating already.

11:54.900 --> 11:58.100
Haré-sama, you should wash your face and
change clothes.

11:58.370 --> 12:00.230
Wow, amazing!

12:00.970 --> 12:04.370
Mom really was a rich girl!

12:14.320 --> 12:15.790
Oh, good morning.

12:16.420 --> 12:17.850
Who are you?

12:18.320 --> 12:23.090
Am I supposed to be happy or irritated by
that reaction of yours?

12:23.330 --> 12:25.920
I-I mean, that's not how you are!

12:26.060 --> 12:28.430
Mom, you're usually like...
wolfing down the rice, slurping the soup...

12:28.430 --> 12:30.830
...and you say good morning dressed in
nothing besides your panties!

12:32.800 --> 12:33.770
Hurry up and eat.

12:34.400 --> 12:36.570
Thank goodness,
it's the Mom that I always knew.

12:40.480 --> 12:43.040
This knife is cumbersome... but it's tasty!

12:43.450 --> 12:44.570
Hey... where's Guu?

12:44.920 --> 12:46.940
Guu left already.

12:47.180 --> 12:49.120
Left? W-Where to?

12:49.420 --> 12:50.280
Dunno.

12:50.390 --> 12:52.750
She said she was going
to have a little fun outside.

12:53.090 --> 12:55.250
H-Have a little fun!?

13:10.040 --> 13:11.970
Wait, I'm going to go look for Guu!

13:12.140 --> 13:14.540
Wait, you haven't finished your meal yet!!

13:14.880 --> 13:15.540
But...

13:15.680 --> 13:17.200
Playtime can wait until after your meal!

13:17.280 --> 13:19.150
No, I'm not going to go play!

13:19.420 --> 13:22.850
You can't listen to what your mother says!?

13:26.020 --> 13:26.790
All right, I finished my meal!

13:26.790 --> 13:27.920
I'm gonna go now!

13:29.430 --> 13:32.290
Oh, my, Haré-sama is in such a good mood!

13:32.460 --> 13:34.930
He's still young.
He can't get enough playtime.

13:35.070 --> 13:39.160
Oh, I feel like a superhero of justice that can't
reveal his true self to others.

13:39.640 --> 13:43.000
If I left Guu alone, who knows what she'd do.

13:44.470 --> 13:46.310
Where should I start looking for her?

13:54.520 --> 13:56.350
It's the guy from yesterday, Robert.

14:08.070 --> 14:11.230
Amazing! He hit the bulls-eye
with all of them!

14:11.800 --> 14:13.830
His shooting skills are second to none...

14:14.200 --> 14:15.870
...although he always makes
mistakes about where to shoot.

14:15.970 --> 14:17.460
You've still got room for improvement.

14:21.750 --> 14:24.150
Guu? Why is Guu there?

14:24.410 --> 14:26.250
Oh, I'm embarrassed.

14:26.250 --> 14:29.690
And furthermore, for some reason, she
seems rather masculine.

14:30.520 --> 14:32.650
Can you show me an example again?

14:32.990 --> 14:35.290
Sure, if that's what you want...

14:35.560 --> 14:37.360
And she's talking like a guy, too?

14:52.210 --> 14:55.180
Oh, but she only hit the
target with one of her shots...

14:55.350 --> 14:56.400
A-Amazing!

14:56.480 --> 15:00.580
I can't do one-hole shots unless
I'm really in top condition!

15:01.380 --> 15:04.380
It's simple to shoot through the same hole.

15:04.820 --> 15:06.580
You're kidding!? Is that for real!?

15:07.060 --> 15:09.120
It's as if it was your arm.

15:09.490 --> 15:10.820
It is her arm!

15:12.500 --> 15:13.050
Who's there!?

15:14.500 --> 15:15.400
An intruder!?

15:16.300 --> 15:19.360
An intruder? He sounds so old fashioned.

15:19.700 --> 15:21.900
Actually, I don't need to hide, do I?

15:22.210 --> 15:24.970
That's right, I can make an
ordinary appearance.

15:25.110 --> 15:26.110
This is suspicious.

15:26.110 --> 15:28.870
Perhaps a spy has
snuck in from somewhere.

15:29.280 --> 15:30.210
A spy!?

15:30.910 --> 15:31.400
Wait...

15:31.480 --> 15:34.310
Isn't it better for us to get
rid of 'em right now?

15:34.520 --> 15:35.680
Hey, come on!

15:35.750 --> 15:38.590
Even though they don't realize it's me...
don't go saying stuff like that!

15:39.020 --> 15:41.890
Well, I'm sure it's nothing more
than someone from the lower end
of the food chain...

15:41.890 --> 15:44.420
...like someone who just
came out from a distant jungle.

15:44.730 --> 15:47.250
No, she's saying this
because she realizes it's me!

15:47.630 --> 15:49.430
I don't know who you are, but come out!

15:49.700 --> 15:52.030
If you come out peacefully,
I won't do anything!

15:52.240 --> 15:54.670
That's what he says, but he's so ready and
willing to shoot...

15:54.770 --> 15:57.100
Oh man, he's aiming! He's aiming his gun!

15:57.170 --> 15:59.700
I-If I went out right now, he'd kill me!?

15:59.980 --> 16:01.270
But, if I don't...

16:01.710 --> 16:03.910
Shoot before they take the initiative.

16:04.710 --> 16:05.540
Ah, you're right.

16:05.750 --> 16:07.240
So I'll get shot either way!?

16:08.420 --> 16:11.440
Dammit, I have to take my chances!

16:11.860 --> 16:14.350
W-Wait a minute! I-It's me!

16:16.990 --> 16:18.360
Oh, it's you, Hare-sama.

16:18.460 --> 16:20.600
It's dangerous for you
to be in a place like this.

16:20.600 --> 16:22.120
Yup. Dangerous, dangerous.

16:22.230 --> 16:24.890
The existence of you two in this world is
more dangerous!!

16:25.240 --> 16:27.100
Don't you go busting out that gun
everywhere!

16:27.200 --> 16:28.270
Oh, I apologize.

16:28.270 --> 16:28.860
Oh you are?!

16:29.370 --> 16:32.360
Those three seem to be
getting along very well...

16:32.840 --> 16:34.070
You're right.

16:34.280 --> 16:35.770
Don't you get close to him anymore!

16:35.880 --> 16:36.710
It's dangerous!

16:36.880 --> 16:39.780
Hm, it's true that he faces life-or-death
situations...

16:41.050 --> 16:43.610
Nine times out of ten,
the danger is your fault.

16:44.550 --> 16:47.180
Oh my, you look like
you're having so much fun.

16:47.660 --> 16:50.680
You call this having fun?

16:51.060 --> 16:51.790
Robert.

16:51.860 --> 16:52.350
Yes?

16:52.730 --> 16:58.930
Ojou-sama has seen how you three were
having fun, so she insisted that you look
after the children.

16:59.270 --> 17:00.670
W-What!? Mom did!?

17:04.670 --> 17:05.900
Yes, I'm honored!

17:06.080 --> 17:07.370
W-Why is this!?

17:07.440 --> 17:11.040
I don't want someone dangerous like this to
be at my side, even for one second!

17:11.850 --> 17:14.650
But, it'd be immature of me
to make a fuss like that...

17:14.650 --> 17:17.680
...and I've never had anything go well when I
spoke the truth.

17:18.150 --> 17:20.250
Right now, I need to calm down, and...

17:20.660 --> 17:27.690
Well, I wouldn't mind, but Guu seems to want
to keep her distance from Robert...

17:28.030 --> 17:30.160
Well, actually, they seem to be awfully close.

17:34.910 --> 17:36.770
I can't think this is anything other than her
giving me a hard time.

17:37.040 --> 17:39.630
I'm sure it's just you
that thinks so, Haré-sama.

17:40.110 --> 17:40.770
Um...

17:40.910 --> 17:42.710
Then, Robert, I trust you to do a good job.

17:42.710 --> 17:43.200
Roger!

17:43.480 --> 17:44.340
Now then...

17:45.250 --> 17:47.110
Let's be chummy and visit the city.

17:47.350 --> 17:49.010
I will never go out!

17:49.350 --> 17:51.250
Well then, you don't have to come, Haré.

17:51.390 --> 17:53.320
I'll go with just Robert.

17:54.760 --> 17:55.990
Hold on just a minute!

17:56.790 --> 17:58.020
You want to go?

17:58.190 --> 17:59.390
No! You shouldn't go!

17:59.560 --> 18:01.220
In the first place, why are you heading out?

18:05.200 --> 18:06.230
Don't worry about it.

18:06.400 --> 18:07.730
I am too going to worry!

18:07.940 --> 18:09.370
What was that look on your face!?

18:09.440 --> 18:10.430
What are you thinking of doing!?

18:10.510 --> 18:11.440
Say something!

18:12.010 --> 18:15.640
This may not be an adequate description,
but how about, "riot?"

18:16.710 --> 18:18.200
That's more than adequate!

18:19.050 --> 18:21.140
Can I tag along with you guys after all?

18:21.720 --> 18:23.310
Sure, but it makes me worry.

18:24.350 --> 18:25.120
Very true.

18:25.360 --> 18:26.290
What?

18:26.460 --> 18:28.690
The city is full of danger...

18:28.960 --> 18:30.950
Let's head out after we do a bit of training.

18:31.560 --> 18:32.530
Training?

18:33.500 --> 18:35.230
T-This is...

18:35.430 --> 18:36.560
A bullet-proof vest.

18:36.770 --> 18:38.700
I thought the color gray would be a safe bet.

18:38.770 --> 18:40.460
I hope you like it...

18:40.540 --> 18:42.630
No, it's not about the color!

18:42.770 --> 18:45.300
Why do I have to wear something like this!?

18:45.810 --> 18:47.870
This is to protect you, Haré-sama.

18:48.180 --> 18:48.940
From what?

18:49.150 --> 18:50.340
From everything.

18:50.450 --> 18:51.880
The city is a concrete jungle...

18:51.950 --> 18:53.540
...you don't know what will come attack you.

18:53.680 --> 18:56.880
When you take one step outside home, think
of everyone as an enemy.

18:57.020 --> 18:57.510
Now...

18:58.860 --> 18:59.550
Somehow...

18:59.620 --> 19:02.820
I wonder if this guy has a history of being
betrayed by his friends?

19:03.030 --> 19:05.650
Now that you have adequate defense...

19:05.760 --> 19:06.390
Next up...

19:07.260 --> 19:09.160
Haré-sama, I'd like you
to aim and shoot as well.

19:10.930 --> 19:12.060
It's part of the training.

19:12.800 --> 19:14.430
Please aim at that target.

19:14.940 --> 19:15.870
Target...

19:16.440 --> 19:19.640
I see, if it's a target, it's just sport shooting.

19:19.780 --> 19:22.140
If that's the case, nobody will get hurt.

19:23.080 --> 19:24.010
All right!

19:24.480 --> 19:27.850
How Guu was poised earlier...
was it like this?

19:28.420 --> 19:30.280
If it's a sport, I can do it, too.

19:36.260 --> 19:37.950
Maybe it's impossible for me after all...

19:38.600 --> 19:41.330
There's no way that I'd hit...

19:43.230 --> 19:44.960
Bulls-eye!?

19:45.300 --> 19:46.100
Haré...

19:48.370 --> 19:50.460
Guu! Are you all right!?

19:51.210 --> 19:52.470
It's all over...

19:53.380 --> 19:55.210
Get a grip!!

19:55.680 --> 19:58.770
Don't worry about me. Keep moving ahead.

20:00.150 --> 20:00.950
To where?

20:01.020 --> 20:05.250
Overcome my death, and mature as a human.

20:05.420 --> 20:06.190
Guu...

20:06.190 --> 20:09.630
Is it just me, or does she seem a little too
collected about this death of hers?

20:11.660 --> 20:13.690
Guu!

20:15.300 --> 20:19.260
Oh, a gun... I never should have held it...

20:20.000 --> 20:21.600
I'm sorry, Guu...

20:22.310 --> 20:26.870
If I knew this was going to happen, I would
have been nicer, and more friendly to you.

20:31.580 --> 20:32.550
Robert?

20:32.980 --> 20:33.810
This...

20:34.680 --> 20:35.650
Over there...

20:37.750 --> 20:42.250
Haré-sama, you're still a child,
so I gave you a toy gun.

20:43.160 --> 20:44.820
Surprise!

20:46.060 --> 20:47.960
It was an amazing bit of acting!

20:47.960 --> 20:50.260
I almost believed you, too!

20:50.400 --> 20:53.670
They say, to fool an enemy you must first
fool your allies.

20:53.840 --> 20:55.960
That has nothing to do with this!

20:56.470 --> 20:58.530
That's enough, cut it out, both of you!

20:59.080 --> 21:00.870
That's a footrace starter pistol.

21:02.350 --> 21:03.900
All right, it's a race!

21:05.010 --> 21:06.920
Wait!

21:06.920 --> 21:08.510
What's wrong with you guys!

21:08.590 --> 21:10.280
Oh, see there, Ojou-sama.

21:10.590 --> 21:13.610
Haré-sama and the others
are playing tag in the yard.

21:14.120 --> 21:16.360
Oh, you're right...
They're really full of energy.

21:16.360 --> 21:17.330
I'm so glad.

21:17.560 --> 21:21.260
I thought he'd be longing for the jungle after
coming to the city so suddenly.

21:21.530 --> 21:24.260
But the boy didn't
have the time for such thoughts.

22:35.240 --> 22:36.170
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.170 --> 22:38.270
Robert doesn't like my mom?

22:38.270 --> 22:39.540
Why?

22:39.540 --> 22:43.510
It's true that my mom is lazy, and rough, and goes at her own pace in a bad
way...

22:43.510 --> 22:45.980
...or rather forcefully goes her own way.

22:45.980 --> 22:46.310
If he were to see Mom seriously
doing her best at something. Robert might...

22:46.310 --> 22:49.880
If he were to see Mom seriously
doing her best at something, Robert might...

22:49.880 --> 22:53.390
There's only one thing that
Weda would get serious about...

22:53.390 --> 22:56.650
Bluntly put, that's her son in a crisis.

22:56.720 --> 22:58.020
This again!?

22:58.630 --> 22:59.860
Next episode of Haré+Guu: "Pachimon"

22:59.860 --> 23:02.360
Next episode of Haré+Guu: "Pachimon"

23:02.360 --> 23:04.670
Who's the pachimon!?
